  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14111253/assets/d1a19303937f1d515ca820516e10a73974b00f83884b05abb58dee49c81207f4.png)\n\nConsider a plate of mass $M$ that occupies the region $D$ in the upper half plane bounded by the circle ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=16,$ shown above. Given that the mass is distributed uniformly across the plate, find the moment of inertia of the plate about the $y$-axis.",
